{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1537,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28c0fea378106b0c2d9990f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…没想到在那之后，连我也\n穿上了礼服――不过\n…呵呵呵。真的很漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "770f0bc33e13da51ec88762a078569a9214bece59018f09b9727d400046089cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8090492eae79b9dadec764ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "房间里…摆满了鲜花。装满了\n大家送来的『祝福』。\n――呵呵…真是幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db1cdcfad109f7a8740690743ae38f680e9cb2b050b5174ce8d9fdc87c0f4409",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e66e11436f0e0bb8c1813a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有想要传达的人——\n所以，我才能迈步向前——\n束起荣誉，赠予你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68aa63a664874c13f854a1f5e8e062a1146642da74193133b44951253e42886c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ecbcbb2712f04f203c58e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务――有什么\n困难吗？如果不介意的话\n请让我来帮您吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c67e696b489a7ae44e815bf959808b5b3a04294f1213fb5c1e63911cb5045586",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bafc1cf279fca531e258f2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动…辛苦了。\n这是我们送上的祝福――如果您能\n收下的话，我会很高兴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ec78078a03bc3bb79b062d466acf48a4565190c4c6a610d9af52756db93fed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b6149e5048f285a1fc66bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live的光辉也——献给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe93ce75811326a159cd66b46dcfb77ca6d8ff0e6b5dd500c9fc3931eab4561",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31c69eb25858d4ffb7dbc024",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这是一场让会场合而为一的Live。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a2b0c44dbd6738d3f9bc20af360ae2dda7b5cba6fc1572c48afd99450b181c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2c747be00e81502dd403c8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天，要为您献上一束花……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88066061ed9912705176e500b3126cbeae8e8122ebaeb96dc3b4496d01418f94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16d9720d60168b35d44d3ec3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "温暖而温柔——为我指明道路的你。\n今后无论多少次——\n我都会来把盛大的花束交给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a814d82b6a50fcb7061b2054a49a2631a2e4a36423ea2a8c5a37db6f846a38c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ff93e15b8afbe7e22510159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫色与白色的配色——像三色堇一样漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ca9cc92d4e6c417078ad92f108f6755431db5442ab3745d53fd313db32af0a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de1a1c99bfce38de664c7c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会——成为比任何人都更能汇聚欢呼的中心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "339fe7fe8675532e157aedba605992073bfe88651ea5a20c4ad922008108598f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bab984dc7ca2eda58a403a98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "内衬上的花，我纠结到最后才决定好搭配。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c047aac7151d5eedb460ddf1d0d453536c7dc52d0dc6712464af97d4424bc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a5c533b6b39cbabcfd9bcdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和发箍的调和，我也很喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cacaba47e8b185d08ab32d7e57d232b092e5ee99b7ecb5f1100c035908927d57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09c5c5b3067864ca6ecc4158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想像盛放的花朵一样——起舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a5e62d78707c77858d8999525c55496001266fcccb5d782021fbc0f4efb8d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:463284b62457c5747c5f943e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的誓言绝不会动摇——黑色就是它的体现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "454ab6b357cf185173518be7b5cd34ed448ef2b3eb2cea8cef134156d6f04b1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e50d585d6feeed709a3268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一次，就用这份色彩——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34276149b17a051c634c38dd684d6b9b6c5065d0795e2a948bf74ec1afcfd24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5297cfd973c9004707f1ba0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装也像花一样——有着各式各样的魅力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "727ab56daf8619c41ee940ce1b9cdb9c5985c04438973afaad89e98653a40bed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2fbfb78aea1702e634cb659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对这身花纹一见钟情…这是我最喜欢的一套。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a622b8eef884b7145801eed4eafdb802fdd54683d2ecf9a09c0c18a0d4faf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35117c117940d874a14a7fb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沉稳的色调——总是能治愈我的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2040d06bb621d83946a7d2f43578af47452876ffda6d8c62be9133ac7ed87aa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ce1868899afff7e58734b5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫色与白色的配色——像堇花一样漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1c0694fa07121daf087ce0c0dc8767383db00247ade1c14274fe7b5a31315aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:992c5e1ecb6b2543ca455982",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会——成为比任何人都更能汇聚欢呼的中心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "339fe7fe8675532e157aedba605992073bfe88651ea5a20c4ad922008108598f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:792b32ad665c1fb27a2ca39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "内衬上的花，我纠结到最后才决定好搭配。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c047aac7151d5eedb460ddf1d0d453536c7dc52d0dc6712464af97d4424bc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe064de5624ed4aa1152b403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和发箍的调和，我也很喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cacaba47e8b185d08ab32d7e57d232b092e5ee99b7ecb5f1100c035908927d57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ff28e48d40ae39f27ad75b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想像盛放的花朵一样——起舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a5e62d78707c77858d8999525c55496001266fcccb5d782021fbc0f4efb8d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd2177d930ce5e20392bcb24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的誓言绝不会动摇——黑色就是它的体现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "454ab6b357cf185173518be7b5cd34ed448ef2b3eb2cea8cef134156d6f04b1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b3ac76d2613312e28c77e80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一次，就用这份色彩——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34276149b17a051c634c38dd684d6b9b6c5065d0795e2a948bf74ec1afcfd24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc8ec577befcc155e76468f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装也像花一样——有着各式各样的魅力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "727ab56daf8619c41ee940ce1b9cdb9c5985c04438973afaad89e98653a40bed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd4791248001c8f5c30a5d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:830c839185780ce3097636e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝阳——真舒服呢。\n放声欢呼同学的早安英里也格外\n有精神，让我也得到了活力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69c705d7d8c406d83bf49ec67c442a9d5beace85d719c7db445df769d6eaa339",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862d36057553eab330a6ffe2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿我能让你那温和的目光——\n染上幸福的色彩。\n我——今天也会努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09954fc04b234951992bdabe09b4a1073df8ba1e00ab3e7c56d393bd1aeb134f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50c8aa75e302d40b7378089f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "营养与色彩——在小小的箱庭中\n诞生的调和。做便当，\n总是——让我很雀跃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "523e69e26a68205af313288b9d8bb8470e40fd1c2a2c2a796cf5dd9f93f0bcbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56d9cd0dd6e06b6fae81458d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的配菜，是香菇酿肉。\n…是的。营养满分，而且\n只要不看背面…就不、可怕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ea4263a5498bb7ccb2aa89621fbdeef4c9093709d95db411c2711b43a0ab16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:007292a874272b2bc6385552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今晚——我约好了和杏目同学一起\n制作使用花香的身体凝胶。\n呵呵，要用什么花好呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe82d81c31daabed58cff11a1a0ace37b79035758a16775f9217a171e249c85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d32312ab71b96905834a2af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "规律的睡眠——能调整体内的调和。\n睡不着的时候，\n我会为你泡花草茶的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fd8f89143cfe26f5c524df1be9065da24b022aeb5b79808f0a0e12812e3a8d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d48ed7cdd532ccc28d33e8f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我送给洛林军歌同学的人偶\n一顶白三叶草花冠。\n因为粉色搭配白色，应该会很好看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "688eeffaae398d4ec4177a09fb4a3cc2cee9012f9561acc814785f522630b421",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78b7daeef175bd7df5913cc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "附近种向日葵的孩子们——\n已经长大了好多。一定很快\n就会超过向日葵的高度吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c85dc924d7281e002b4a5e477eda9c6a11c6f0207b3e40f3831db1d27584f3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b272ffb34356d1fe71b851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了菊花展的季节呢。倾注心血\n培育出的菊花并排绽放的景象——\n想必会非常华丽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db28aafaff18bace124ee6cc337ff1cfb0f38f8e60d16d35b32ba6a41446c01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dad5eb6ac72207dc4da51ae1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在训练员室放了花艺作品。\n紫罗兰、香雪球——\n希望即使在冬天，也能送来色彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef03b678fcb6d51739098a61306803c2e2f1559a0d77742990aed6720ba251f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13da426a1b7345a1e84f82c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节…快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f00db3e963ae79161d53fc9ad5a7765faf562b04c97561d53d114d1c4c5f6ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54ee3e5bd213e8dd8dbad7bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和创世驹同学决定事情的时候——\n我们会用猜拳来决定。\n因为彼此都会——一直互相谦让。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5bce3a36eb4887883117ea8e167285cf294014f3c70610352bc710fd2f90e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdef971bf578ef7a8f08cc75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我送给唯独爱你同学花束后，她会在直播中\n开心地提起这件事。\n那份笑容——总是能治愈我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e274789af1184d492cca717d733abb8c24d486656f256c3f46c8fa3be879e269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:245147bbe148c5af795b3f1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃沙拉的放声欢呼同学，总是\n一脸幸福。要不要用食用花\n在盘子上做一束花呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f76428e6509cdaf307a2e50701876e92ca8b043a250b81bd2045be96bdcbf71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7da56585b281d1879f949f54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神业同学的漫画里——\n偶尔会出现我的花艺作品。\n…真是让我惶恐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c50eb7fddc6e8d9a3e4065095c831248a1cd883a4720cfcb41afc49a3b18f724",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a169e9c7a7c7cb73202afd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "命运——我并不是很懂。\n不过被神威启示同学牵着手，\n前往各种地方…会让我很兴奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eef1e871c1db880fc74b8b57595a5db2451075efe7b9ee873c23af945b78418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcb4957c2c29e8038172be10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着同样的衣装配合呼吸——\n让一份狂热绽放。\n这样的演唱会也很好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "989cecb45a4bf831a32e9713574bcfd315d5e0aa786bf2984498a6909e18d1ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d54e15090b1af20eb7bedfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "露出较多的衣装——\n会让我有些不太自在。\n跳舞的时候——总觉得腿边不安定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbadf8535c29984eb60b274ed79b22c74a41e53a75f9c6aa63927351f9b981dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6ad9f9938a7df8eeeecd95b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣装，是以献给你的花束\n为意象设计的。用欢呼点缀，\n束起胜利——成为荣光的花束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a75b93d9fbf6a6ba635c8d113fa6bceb8effe2725a6eaca7fef94710fd1684",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc8314e2282ecd566c1b08a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装设计——我也请真机伶\n帮忙商量过。\n我想下定决心——做得更华丽些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9adc876dd435c52559a6e56dae04914efd97c3d8d2ebbced60f40a4e60891fdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e75d3532e2d7bb1db7a3a4f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鸟儿的鸣叫，雨声——\n对我和也文摄辉同学来说，\n自然的闹钟是最好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08de169892a20db471660cc413a29e572cd743e13c1bdff54647fd496fa9a659",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bb7978d4499f26dc54adf19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时，创世驹同学帮我拍了花。\n能看出她很认真面对被拍摄的东西…\n那是一张很棒的照片。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c1b714c3f017b17db4b1d4f1ac0bfaa10fda986524ea784eef9f85e8474edd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3a9d684d7857bcfb1bff40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我竟然在梦话里念着\n花的名字…。确实，我是在为\n做花束而烦恼…呜呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84b20a46f40690125736bb20282d9bc62c04dae0a2f226a1774e051ed598bc49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c54ee4d48c351e16247c1fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说喜欢香豌豆之后——\n唯独爱你同学邀请我去采花会。\n我们留下了很棒的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a23904bc5900721c20a0b6893dd2a167512f4192b11f504e7cbcd7975068201",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:991b1519b13de4e146960356",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和同期的大家一起去的摊位——\n让我不由得回到了童心。\n尤其是型抜游戏…我还想再挑战一次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "935ef1b818645fa50a1778a118f04ea07e0648e20c8729911c663c6ff78e98a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bc422cfe98cd90f4dfd78c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花朵和阔叶树都色彩鲜艳的季节。\n每周和也文摄辉同学一起\n巡游色彩丰富的群山——我都很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79d65173419fabdd67d1962e222d1f82982729230c30aef1cca877c43316ab60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7b5ae54a316196c925c8aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对于雪道上盛开的花——\n我能做的事情有限。\n但至少想帮它们拂去积雪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96b4bc7919ac47699cc7531db5773f4356b5ed09f9d101e0bfcf5900d0cc023c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5062fee4d8b9771b627565e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让你的献身得到回报——\n我会拿出结果。\n即使需要时间——也一定会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc08b467314b54bf327e0fa366d408d4c4fb76c94b98beed7264bf1435fa9f56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ba548a0240710171104b129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。\n愿我们的梦想——能够开花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "831daa37e856c8b9efd455abe5acf0b3589f572dd3b3fe2d8859f2b7a01ab4c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48fba11655f63b3c01c5a350",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很温柔——但是。\n训练中还请你——\n严格一些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "379c21b7b3d2240166517e21444393be02052f9116fa9126c82097c00e44baa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22301efc1c221f966f6ed23d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿努力有朝一日能结出果实——\n让我们一步一步整理土壤吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea53be57ec1e6fe322afe01aed4f9f8a661b216b8f3bf5343db7b3da248f129b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd6e0a5b9e60cbf4382eb5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对于竞争，我仍然有些犹豫。\n即便如此——我也想迈出脚步。\n现在，我是这么想的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d573986dd42304ecbe89e221eb45ebc4dd5a0472e600fa38788226292ce85d2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2885268ba1e8f72b585a03bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赌上梦想互相竞争——\n并不是破坏调和…而是能创造出\n更加耀眼的光辉，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "371d72ba4de807990f55552c1640614cfd36b9028439e92202e053218a027dc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:237f57b480e4374a46487bfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会比任何人都跑得更快——\n成为引领调和的存在，\n献上最棒的花束——给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14141274ca0fe1093854a845e4287a7a12d73d3a0437634eaaccd59c0c2663d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:826b2caab8c0c36ed04ad1f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单叶蔓荆和滨石竹…有些花\n正因为在海岸边才能看到。\n——之后要不要一起去看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a212d1bf6bdc97acbcd47c8591e8ea10bd2ba4eef1e5259ba9c4c683c5828076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:106d896c6d7a8d7b23ca785b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请收下这束——只属于你的、耀眼绽放的花束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6186596b89a30524cb6db48f561605180308722eb5af2534e155983b0d5a5a36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8777750194c3ecfb962659ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我创造出了——美丽的调和。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04ddccc45a03cc7e1d9489f0e4ec70e0951baae8a230d5c20a43772ea844b76e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69210dfa8404376a5a61477f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "色彩——变多了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd449a4552e1e6df64a4356277d17ff2d3d5c09f4633c608e75fc8d2d1a84784",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:921a0fedd801ebe5cf57da3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们扩展——美丽的调和吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01aa71bc2a06311e3983716f326a10dc710d92f0ba94a97b4e2855bd8da8d606",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:768e8ec57b0d83a5377f628b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶金花——献上花束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bdd751c83ca7b21570c87b12dca9fd91188e99b82692d377ce076b66ce82d8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4095ed42c0686f5565b6ac32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鲜艳地绽放，亲手完成。\n——荣光的花束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65e2a78d7af4163acc8dafa4e2951fa3d11072d2dce13d33002ac149d6eef15e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98f3b61a27445722c00f5bb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调和与，色彩……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a005a3c136079d05ac1c266c36aa87ee0fbbfbf5f0158d31fa62b7cf1a52662b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4549c1c9eb3956cad448b47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花艺的搭配，就像这样……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdd2536eee407f1bb2b308a0d096506f3a738ad5d9bc967a8b9d28f3eda2aeb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30d9ed1fea55eb81cba70b4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，轻松点去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32812700b8b48674954f1b89a99d7d119fe50792cddb36f105cb9560cd700ee6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f813aaae3fd3ca94942b4cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜欢旅行带回来的伴手礼吗？\n不过对你来说，\n“我”才是最棒的那份大礼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2b9856d0dd38a955839a9a348d9d852a4e24e27ca923e6eeb37d21b2955c66d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6f19fbefcddec4c03d06c31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那，我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "988ef158a4fdab34c73d3cb5b5b067300841192c9eea8ca1561d9439d4c92d1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0741b7ba1fe8f36a3cb643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef3dcf02aed6bad3606301d1383da46bc6b743d218a4ae27da93cd089795e59e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2a1149f6ecc53955d7f0fad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会在这所学园待上一阵子吧。\n我很喜欢你给我的那些刺激。\n那么，今天要做什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8a36a637d74e9717f2f920d056532003d1dfc02df11f37c230cb06626d05d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cce68989cbbd4945eea4b5c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不过，我也和你去了不少地方呢。\n这样的话，下次……\n干脆试着回一趟彼此的老家吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5562552210914f7223b4d896f5ad6d4eaa387d75918fe91d6936d3903d173bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa638c91b78e7462fe031da2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每个国家新年的气氛都不一样。\n虽然以前总是到处奔走……\n但和熟悉的面孔一起迎接新年，也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e611f4ca3e83e4298e7c9202ec7d58bbf4fb2e0164fe2e798f20843b151a7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d150866a661b5e7168e2617",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，喜欢巧克力吗？\n黄金船刚才送来的。\n……味道挺刺激的吧？待会一起吃吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "932495ed9c93ceaca68e968ef3bda627ea48869eb8e89676f9409b9dc2c64c0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d6fc8afec1ced534ebdc6d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到处都是甜甜的味道……大家都喜欢呢。\n我倒是无法理解。要是你想要的话……\n牵起我的手，把我带走就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a9d1ee20ee8c10d6020533ab1854059a70c664d5765836a9f58d1aeb956832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
